From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:24:27 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 81/85] hjviewer: integration fixes for 1.8.2
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- danger as text is dangerText (tokens lane): the phone look of
  hjvDangerButton, the U68 confirms' action, now reads as
  deleteConfirmDialog's [OK] does, and a field's error line under it is
  dangerText as colorScheme.error is; the icons keep danger
- the selected pill's name (words lane) is primaryStrong on primarySoft
- the gate's note blocks go in through hjvKeepAll as the others do: the
  U68 confirms' warning and the note over the remote PC's password
  dialog (U01)
- one "더 보기": the desktop home's ID card ⋮ uses hjvLabels.more (gate
  lane) and HjvTexts.more (home lane) goes
- the account texts outside hjviewer_account.dart come from
  hjvAppTexts() instead of a new HjvTexts with its own language check
  (the peer card's online state, the desktop home's ID menu, the login
  request's errors)
- hjviewer_account_widgets_test finds the login notice's password hint
  as hjvKeepAll draws it
- hjviewer_suggestions_test no longer checks HjvTexts.more

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
